<!--
Cleartext is needed by SPA over HTTP only: fwknopd sniffs a plain "GET /<packet>" (the packet is
already encrypted and authenticated). A domain-config cannot scope it: the servers are typed by the
user at run time and the request goes to the resolved IP literal, not a known host name.
Every other request stays on HTTPS by code (the IP lookup URL is rejected unless https://).
Trust anchors keep the platform default (system CAs only).
-->
<network-security-config>
  <base-config cleartextTrafficPermitted="true" />
</network-security-config>
